<p class="legal__lede">Short version: this website does not use cookies, analytics or advertising trackers, so there is no cookie banner to click through.</p>

<h2>1. Cookies</h2>
<p>This website does not set any cookies of its own<% if (!turnstileOn) { %>, and it loads nothing from third parties that could set them<% } %>. We do not run Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, heatmaps, session recording or any other tracking tool.</p>

<h2>2. Local storage</h2>
<p>If you press the <b>pause-motion</b> button (bottom-right of the home page), your browser remembers that choice in local storage under the name <code>onyx-motion</code>, so animations stay paused on your next visit. It stores only "on" or "off", never leaves your device, and is not shared with anyone. You can remove it by clearing your browser's site data.</p>

<h2>3. Third-party services</h2>
<% if (turnstileOn) { %>
<p>One: <b>Cloudflare Turnstile</b>, a spam check on the contact form. It loads only when you scroll to the form and is used solely to tell people from bots, which makes it strictly necessary for keeping the form secure. Cloudflare's own privacy policy explains what it processes. Everything else (typefaces and code) is served from our own server.</p>
<% } else { %>
<p>None. All typefaces and code are served from our own server, so your browser does not connect to Google, content-delivery networks or any other third party while you browse this site.</p>
<% } %>
<p>There are no embedded videos, maps, social media widgets or chat tools on this site.</p>

<h2>4. Why there is no consent banner</h2>
<p>Consent banners are needed for cookies and trackers that are not strictly necessary, such as analytics and advertising. Because we use none<% if (turnstileOn) { %> (the spam check is a security measure, not a tracker)<% } %>, and the only stored item is a preference you set yourself, there is nothing to consent to. If we ever add analytics or similar tools, we will ask for your consent before they load and update this policy.</p>

<h2>5. Controlling cookies</h2>
<p>You can block or delete cookies and site data at any time in your browser settings. The site works fully with all cookies and storage blocked.</p>
